Open OpenWork with a local or cloud model

Usage: wally openwork [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model on this machine, or a hosted one from your
                              account
      --hybrid                Run the main agent on a cloud model and its
                              subagents on a local model
      --cloud-model TEXT      The cloud model the main agent uses with --hybrid
                              (default: your default model)
      --policy TEXT           What --hybrid optimises for: privacy (default) or
                              cost

Examples:
  # The certified local model, with your hosted models beside it
  wally openwork -m qwen3-4b-instruct-2507

  # A hosted model (needs `wally account login`)
  wally openwork -m glm-5.3-flash
